<!--
  Vector icon set — Lucide (https://lucide.dev), ISC License (free/permissive,
  no attribution required), ported from their SVG source to WPF geometries so
  they render crisp at any size and pick up the theme color via Stroke.
  One family, one stroke weight (VectorIcon), one 24x24 grid everywhere —
  that consistency is most of what makes the chrome read as one product.
-->
